LibreLoopDVR (LoopDVR)
----------------------

This package ports the LoopDVR architecture for object detection (LoopDet),
instance segmentation (LoopSeg), and human pose estimation (LoopPose) from:

  Intellindust-AI-Lab/LoopDVR
  https://github.com/Intellindust-AI-Lab/LoopDVR
